    <briefdescription>
<para>Coverage information for a macro expansion or #included file. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When covered code has pieces that can be expanded for more detail, such as a preprocessor macro use and its definition, these are represented as expansions whose coverage can be looked up independently. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
